Compile the custom client settings into the binary.

Upstream reads a custom.txt file next to the executable and only accepts it
when it is signed with a key held by RustDesk. This build embeds the settings
at compile time instead (src/custom_client.json, written by scripts/apply.py),
so nothing next to the executable can change them.

